# Generated standalone exam builder — build output, never committed.
# Cloudflare Pages regenerates docs/standalone*.html on every deploy by running
# scripts/build_standalone_html.py as its build command, so the committed copies
# would only drift from what is actually served (and they are ~5 MB each, which
# conflicts badly on upstream merges). Rebuild locally with the same script.
frontend/standalone.html
docs/standalone.html
docs/standalone-enhanced.html

